WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.500
S S T, live in test mode: watch a bad idea die.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.150
Run a search on the test provider. The binding is printed, not hidden.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:16.725
No champion. The candidates fail verification, and the failure is retained.

00:00:18.525 --> 00:00:23.800
Status shows the corpses: four divergences, all failed deterministically.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.650
Promote refuses. Nothing verified, nothing merged.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:35.300
The envelope says test, exit two, mock true. Fixture runs are unmistakable.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.425
Live models need a key. Until then, this rigor is the demo.

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:46.850
The search that shows its corpses.  Run it.
